  "releaseNotes": "Adds managed buckets to object storage. A module declares the bucket it needs with builder.AddManagedBucket(name, owner, description, ...), and at startup object storage creates it with its own policy on a default volume, or adopts an existing bucket of the same name, so the module can use IObjectStore without any setup by an administrator. Administrators keep the infrastructure (volumes, replicas, retention, quotas) but cannot change the contents, access or policy of a managed bucket. No database change is required.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.12/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Api.Core/0.1.0-alpha.12.md",
